WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Still scrolling,

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.160
hoping something will settle your heart?

3
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.840
Romans fifteen gives us a prayer:

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.280
may the God of hope fill you

5
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.680
with joy and peace as you believe,

6
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.980
so you overflow with hope through

7
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.380
the Holy Spirit’s power.

8
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.800
Paul has just pointed to Christ

9
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.220
as the hope of the nations.

10
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.460
God keeps his promises.

11
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.040
Our hope has someone to rest on.

12
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.340
You can bring that prayer into this

13
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.260
restless moment.

14
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:30.200
Lord,

15
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.880
help me trust you.

16
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.580
Fill me with your peace.

17
00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.960
You don’t have to manufacture hope

18
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.620
by yourself.

19
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.860
His Spirit is at work in those

20
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:39.840
who belong to Christ.

21
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.940
Ask him for peace today.

22
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.360
And pray this blessing for someone else

23
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.340
whose heart is weary.
